{
  "description": "std-page-watch — watches every browser tab whose URL matches `match` for elements matching `itemSelector`, and reports each element once as ITEM with the `fields` read from it, now and as the page changes. Needs a host with the `page` service (a browser extension, which asks for access to exactly the `match` pages). Each item carries its tab and element id; compose std-page-treat to hide, blur, highlight or label it.",
